# Allow-list: the context holds only what a target copies (the app target: src, apps, cli, config,
# pyproject.toml, uv.lock; the dev target copies nothing). A new local folder, a `.env`, a database
# or a model can therefore never reach an image.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src
!apps
!cli
!config
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
